        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-22T16:30:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I seriously wish the livestreams were hosted on Youtube. I truly detest Twitch. I'm usually one of the first 50 people to watch whatever gets posted to Youtube, but I've found that sometimes the streams don't make it to Youtube in a timely fashion. It feels like it's an afterthought to have them there at all.</p>",
