        "created_at": "2016-04-04T16:26:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Pretty sure that's fixed now. I've watched several livestreams on youtube in recent weeks(several of the Charlie the Unicorn Kickstarter streams), and the chat seemed to work just fine. And each one was supporting viewership up in the high thousands(pretty sure it hit the millions at some point), so that shouldn't be a problem either.</p><p>I just hope that they're still saveable so I can watch it the next day(Day of the stream is my late day at work, can't catch it).</p>",
